sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BFF as BFF
    participant Service as service
    participant Documents as documents

    Note over Service: Worker event or admin creation request<br/>US worker; no compliance record for this version
    Service->>Service: Generate document UUID
    Service->>Documents: POST /api/v1/documents<br/>uuid, candidate references, S3 object location,<br/>signature definition and stamp coordinates
    Documents->>Documents: Create document record and defer file import
    Documents-->>Service: 201 document UUID, title, status, status_message<br/>No signature request ID
    Service->>Service: Persist worker ID, document UUID and version
    Documents->>Documents: Fetch source S3 file and store its own copy<br/>Create pending signature request

    Note over BFF: Mobile requests GET /api/v1/fintech/signature
    BFF->>Service: GET /api/ewa/v1/requirements/signature<br/>Authenticated worker context
    Service->>Service: Load compliance record and document UUID
    Service->>Documents: GET /api/v1/signatures?document_id={uuid}
    Documents-->>Service: Signature request UUID and status
    Service->>Service: Persist signature request ID and status
    Service-->>BFF: signatureRequired and signatureRequestId
    BFF->>BFF: Prefix ID with docs-signature:<br/>Return signature configuration to mobile

    Note over BFF: Mobile opens the signature through the drive
    BFF->>Documents: GET /api/v1/signatures<br/>Candidate signer filter and status=pending
    Documents-->>BFF: Candidate's pending signature requests
    BFF->>Documents: GET /api/v1/documents/{document_uuid}
    Documents-->>BFF: Document details and stored file URL
    BFF->>BFF: Check candidate reference<br/>Return file URL and signing options to mobile

    Note over BFF: Mobile submits signature response and picture URL<br/>through Sister's candidate signature response route
    BFF->>Documents: GET /api/v1/signatures<br/>Candidate signer filter and status=pending
    Documents-->>BFF: Pending requests for ownership/request validation
    BFF->>Documents: POST /api/v1/signatures<br/>request_uuid, response uuid, signer,<br/>kind and Zeppelin picture location
    Documents->>Documents: Create response; status=processing<br/>Set status=signed; generate and store signed PDF
    Documents-->>BFF: 201 response UUID, request UUID,<br/>document UUID and status
    Note over Documents: No signature-completed event or callback<br/>signed is set before PDF storage finishes

    Note over BFF,Service: Later signature, requirements or eligibility check
    BFF->>Service: Request current requirements or eligibility
    alt Compliance is not already cached as signed
        Service->>Documents: GET /api/v1/signatures?document_id={uuid}
        Documents-->>Service: Current signature request status
        Service->>Service: Update local signature ID/status
    else Compliance is already cached as signed
        Service->>Service: Reuse signed compliance record
    end
    Service-->>BFF: Current requirement or eligibility result
